# TEMPORARY tuning only — NOT the deprecation mechanism (see CLAUDE.md §12).
# To retire a rule: scripts/rulectl deprecate <sid> --reason "..." (disable + exclude).
# Format examples (commented; add real entries with a dated reason):
#
# # 2026-05-18 noisy on internal scanner host, ticket HY-123, review 2026-06-18
# suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 9200001, track by_src, ip 10.0.0.5
#
# # rate-limit a chatty medium rule while tuning
# threshold gen_id 1, sig_id 9100001, type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 60
